{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">解放軍指，菲律賓的小型飛機非法侵入中國黃岩島領空。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南部戰區空軍表示，菲律賓3架小型飛機，周五未經中國政府批准，非法侵入中國黃岩島領空，南部戰區組織海空兵力依法依規跟蹤監視、喊話警告，指菲方行為嚴重侵犯中國主權，極易引發誤解誤判，正告菲方立即停止侵權挑釁。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026gqqsIfoMCS1787320802.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-2300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026kPPs5eNCsM1787320812.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-2300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">又表示戰區部隊時刻保持高度戒備，堅決捍衛國家主權安全和地區和平穩定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T14:19:50.404353+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}